#==============================================================================================
#
#   paintable - Painting::Paintable: the base of every node of the paint tree
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Painting/Paintable.cpp (lines 1-398) and Paintable.h's inline members:
#       a paintable's flags taken from its layout node (positioned, floating, inline, display),
#       its DOM node, computed values, containing block and document, the stacking context it
#       belongs to, repaint invalidation, the inspector overlay, ::selection styling and
#       selection states, normalize_border_radii_data, and HitTestResult::dom_node.
